{"id":"83b85a57869d1385","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-additive.md","title":"Additive","display":"df-additive — Additive","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-additive","aliases":["58-df-additive","Additive"],"display":"df-additive — Additive","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-cardinaladd.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-additive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-additive</span><span>Additive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-additive — Additive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1504fbca72b2f04\" href=\"?note=a1504fbca72b2f04\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-cardinaladd.md\">../batch12/58-df-cardinaladd.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_c:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(+_c:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a1504fbca72b2f04\" href=\"?note=a1504fbca72b2f04\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-cardinaladd.md\">../batch12/58-df-cardinaladd.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_c\">\\(+_c\\)</span> 的有效输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle\\kappa,\\lambda\\rangle:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle\\kappa,\\lambda\\rangle:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 只在唯一满足者存在时取值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additive} \\vdash \\kappa+_c\\lambda\\coloneqq\\iota\\mu\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mu=\\left|(\\kappa\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\lambda\\times\\{1\\})\\right|\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additive} \\vdash \\kappa+_c\\lambda\\coloneqq\\iota\\mu\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mu=\\left|(\\kappa\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\lambda\\times\\{1\\})\\right|\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Additive cardinal arithmetic: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa + \\lambda = |A \\cup B|\">\\(\\kappa + \\lambda = |A \\cup B|\\)</span> for disjoint <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A, B\">\\(A, B\\)</span></li>\n<li>For infinite cardinals: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa + \\lambda = \\kappa \\cdot \\lambda = \\max(\\kappa, \\lambda)\">\\(\\kappa + \\lambda = \\kappa \\cdot \\lambda = \\max(\\kappa, \\lambda)\\)</span> (under AC)</li>\n<li>Ordinal addition is non-commutative: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega + 1 \\neq 1 + \\omega = \\omega\">\\(\\omega + 1 \\neq 1 + \\omega = \\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li>Infinite products: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i \\in I} \\kappa_i\">\\(\\prod_{i \\in I} \\kappa_i\\)</span>; countable product of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> many finite sets can be infinite</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-cardinaladd.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1504fbca72b2f04","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-cardinaladd.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-cardinaladd.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1504fbca72b2f04","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$+_c:V^2\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-cardinaladd.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"+_c:V^2\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"+_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle\\kappa,\\lambda\\rangle:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}additive} \\vdash \\kappa+_c\\lambda\\coloneqq\\iota\\mu\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mu=\\left|(\\kappa\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\lambda\\times\\{1\\})\\right|\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa + \\lambda = |A \\cup B|","display":false},{"tex":"A, B","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa + \\lambda = \\kappa \\cdot \\lambda = \\max(\\kappa, \\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega + 1 \\neq 1 + \\omega = \\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i \\in I} \\kappa_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false}],"bytes":1502,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-additive.md|58-df-additive]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","a1504fbca72b2f04","2be08d4ee8aa15